Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.25,0:00:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.62,0:00:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shall we be off then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.03,0:00:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.38,0:00:38.14,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(1779,1)\blur0.2\fs26\fnGeorgia\fsp2.3\c&HFCFBFD&\pos(320,228)}Beyond Journey's End
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.28,0:00:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unusually
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.05,0:00:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,warm today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.09,0:00:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.04,0:00:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take the bonus warmth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.60,0:00:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I would prefer some cold,\Nhard cash if you know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.92,0:00:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four measly coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.27,0:00:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have to look for\Nwork in the next town.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.50,0:01:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We haven't even gotten there yet,\Nand you're thinking about work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.94,0:01:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to survive, wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.45,0:01:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless we stay two steps ahead, our\Njourney will come to a premature end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.34,0:01:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose that is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.41,0:01:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, work it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.72,0:01:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope we find something suitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.49,0:01:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.40,0:01:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.50,0:01:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This feels familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.66,0:01:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much for the ride, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.52,0:01:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.43,0:01:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not every day I have a\Nfirst-class mage in my cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.70,0:01:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could breathe easy thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.44,0:01:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodness, you'll be on the\Nroad to Ende for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.60,0:01:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most folks would never dare\Nventure so far from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.86,0:01:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To all of us in that camp, a journey\Nlike yours sounds un imaginably long.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.45,0:01:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it will be.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.24,0:02:29.25,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(1528,188)\blur0.25\fs33\fnGeorgia\fsp3.0\c&HF8CC9E&\t(2529,5824,\c&HFAFBFA&)\pos(326,245)}Beyond Journey's End
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.27,0:02:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For some reason, you're\Ngetting farther away
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.91,0:02:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behind my eyes, you're always there
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.84,0:03:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, forever, that's right
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.87,0:03:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday, a little bit, the\Ngentle breeze in the world If
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.66,0:03:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we sing, will anything change?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.64,0:03:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a place I can't go back to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.02,0:03:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's where this star lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.35,0:03:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise, I'll take good care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.62,0:03:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep it warm.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.97,0:03:30.98,Signs_WText,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\blur0.2\pos(588.5,16)}29 years after the death of Himmel the Hero,\Nin the Saum Marshes, located in the northern lands
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.47,0:03:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.38,0:03:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.47,0:03:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.72,0:03:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I caught one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.49,0:03:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,FERN I'll add it to our breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.32,0:04:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.60,0:04:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.76,0:04:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.04,0:04:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should be around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.50,0:04:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.41,0:04:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it too early for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.60,0:04:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She woke up curious about something,\Nand curiosity knows no clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.62,0:04:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You praised her, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.52,0:04:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.64,0:04:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.82,0:04:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling it was a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.14,0:04:33.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.23,0:04:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what makes it so special?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.96,0:04:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.07,0:04:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on. I can't conjure fire. [FRIEREN]\NIt's called a magic-nullifying crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.94,0:04:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nullifying crystal it's a\Nmineral that neutralizes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.78,0:04:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,magical effects a specimen of this purity\Nhas an effective radius of three meters
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.11,0:05:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stark step over there for me will you okay
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.51,0:05:10.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there goes this is an\Nextremely rare find even
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.63,0:05:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if it were pebble sized\Nit would be worth several
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.60,0:05:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pieces of gold a crystal\Nthis large could buy us
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.55,0:05:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a mansion sign me up that's\Ngreat but it blocks our
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.14,0:05:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,magic traveling with it\Nwould render us completely
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.48,0:05:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,useless keep it and\Nwe're dead men walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.37,0:05:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tis the burden we bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.29,0:05:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't bear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.66,0:05:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please get rid of the rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.02,0:05:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If a monster attacked right\Nnow, we'd all be wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.67,0:05:42.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, but it would be a shame to leave it\Nwithout sharing its flashiest property.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.39,0:05:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's truly a terrific show.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.39,0:05:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you imbue these stones
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.83,0:05:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with a large amount of mana, they\Nglow with an impressive light.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.62,0:05:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.40,0:05:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just throw that thing away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.36,0:06:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still glowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.15,0:06:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep up our pace and we'll\Nreach the next village today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.58,0:06:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.56,0:06:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're finally getting close\Nto the northern plateau.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.08,0:06:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The plateau is very far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.18,0:06:17.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still must venture through a\Nvast forest and volcanic area.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.04,0:06:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A volcanic area?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.95,0:06:22.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like we're in for some real danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.30,0:06:23.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.33,0:06:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There hasn't been an\Neruption in centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.62,0:06:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These days, it's a relatively\Nsafe hot spring region.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.28,0:06:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hot spring sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.51,0:06:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels like it's been a\Nlifetime since I had a warm bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.73,0:06:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're long overdue for\Nsome rest and relaxation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.23,0:06:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.14,0:06:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.06,0:06:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The earth here is exceptionally thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.38,0:06:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.26,0:07:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it seems we've stumbled\Nupon an underground cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.22,0:07:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ground of a marshland can never\Nbe trusted, hey, Mistress Frieren.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.44,0:07:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Land Rump, first wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.89,0:07:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.96,0:07:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wonder we
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.48,0:07:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,found that magic
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.39,0:07:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nullifying crystal on the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.26,0:07:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a deposit\Nthis large before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.93,0:07:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please get off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.45,0:07:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This cave is practically\Nfilled to the brim with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.00,0:07:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we brought it all back with\Nus, we'd be rich as kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.38,0:07:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid we're not up to the task.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.90,0:07:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magic nullifying crystal is one of\Nthe hardest materials in existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.42,0:07:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That and, unlike
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.33,0:07:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,most stones I've encountered, it can\Nneither be cut nor processed using magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.01,0:07:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.18,0:08:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some treasures of nature are\Nsimply out of humanity 's reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.08,0:08:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In any case, we're not\Nclimbing our way out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.75,0:08:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's look for another exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.46,0:08:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.92,0:08:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why the face?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.88,0:08:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you now, Stark.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.94,0:08:32.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.85,0:08:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since we can't use magic to\Ndefend ourselves down here, we're
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.00,0:08:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,helpless young ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.72,0:08:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Young ladies?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.89,0:08:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.80,0:08:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still haven't forgiven your old\Nhag quip from the dragon duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.54,0:08:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm sorry, expert crutch holding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.75,0:09:20.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I imagined our journey,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.27,0:09:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never pictured camping in a.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.57,0:09:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.72,0:09:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This cave complex is\Nimmense, unbelievably so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.30,0:09:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm not fond of the number\Nof animal bones we've found.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.18,0:09:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to Mistress Frieren, this\Nmight be the den of a giant monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.08,0:09:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm amazed she can sleep so soundly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.24,0:09:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a care in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.80,0:09:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even down here, she still\Nseems to be having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.88,0:09:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm far too afraid to join in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.09,0:09:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't even detect Mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.64,0:10:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel so isolated and helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.44,0:10:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like I've been plunged\Ninto total darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.15,0:10:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.18,0:10:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.92,0:10:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Frieren, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.83,0:10:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.33,0:10:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A venomous apex dragon. Venomous?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.26,0:10:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a terrible matchup for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.51,0:10:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll die from poison again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.56,0:10:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't die the first time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.09,0:10:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.00,0:10:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to fight it, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.70,0:10:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you were\Ndrooling like a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.55,0:10:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you sleep so...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.64,0:10:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could sleep so soundly because\NI trust you with my life, Stark.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.31,0:10:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That feeling solidified within me the very\Nmoment I recruited you to be our warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.13,0:11:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A party can't function properly\Nwithout complete and utter trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.43,0:11:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you trust someone\Nwhose only skill is running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.79,0:11:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had a choice, I would run right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.70,0:11:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.90,0:11:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we run away together, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.64,0:11:17.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stark, Fern, please close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.06,0:11:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Himmel, if you truly trust me with\Nyour life, I question your sanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.94,0:11:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your faith should not be so easily won.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.17,0:11:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I abandoned my village and fled
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.45,0:11:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.86,0:11:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.77,0:11:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to run, we\Ncan run away together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.40,0:11:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.63,0:11:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll follow where you lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.33,0:12:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Running
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.24,0:12:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sounds
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.27,0:12:26.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like a good plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.94,0:12:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scoundrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.85,0:12:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You took the pebble and left\Nthe priest with the boulder!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.88,0:12:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because the pebble will\Ncomplain you stink of liquor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.53,0:12:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.87,0:13:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But running away as a\Nteam isn't so miserable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.30,0:13:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.12,0:13:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we be off, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.88,0:13:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Frieren.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.22,0:13:18.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.96,0:13:21.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't get my legs to take another step.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.03,0:13:25.03,Signs_EpTitle,EPTITLE,0,0,0,,{\blur0.2\c&HFAFFF7&\pos(382,271)}Episode 29: Shall We Go, Then?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.02,0:13:29.03,Signs_WText,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\blur0.2\pos(588.5,16)}29 years after the death of Himmel the Hero,\Nin the Great Sanft Forest, located in the northern lands
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.48,0:13:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will this be enough for lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.29,0:13:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should have picked some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.88,0:13:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.31,0:13:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the first one back?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.16,0:13:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I was too quick\Nwith the gathering, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.84,0:13:47.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it wouldn't hurt\Nto get some fishing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.65,0:13:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to bag a big one this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.85,0:13:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.84,0:13:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.15,0:14:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll reach the hot springs soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.62,0:14:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There. Good as new.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.89,0:14:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was given to you by Stark, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.67,0:14:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A mirrored lotus bracelet\Nis quite the gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I also cleaned off the\Nhairpin you gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.76,0:14:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All bright and shiny again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.50,0:14:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're careful with your staff, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.20,0:14:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem to relish the ritual of\Nmaintaining your equipment , Fern.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.48,0:14:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.73,0:14:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been smiling this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.49,0:14:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I care so much because\Nthey were gifts I lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.17,0:14:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everything from my home to the objects
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.16,0:14:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that filled it to war perhaps a part\Nof me just cherishes the chance to own
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.53,0:14:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,things with meaning
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.63,0:14:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,again and it was well worth the\Nheadache picking it out for you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.24,0:14:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it took you a long time to choose how
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.38,0:14:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you know about that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.33,0:15:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.99,0:15:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i am so so sorry i had no idea the\Ntwo of you would be bathing i swear
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.10,0:15:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm obviously not angry and there all done
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.02,0:15:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh. How confounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.82,0:15:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something's not right here
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.28,0:15:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like what am i alone\Nand feeling an awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.24,0:15:42.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tension
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.15,0:15:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the air definitely\Nnot so you're finally
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.81,0:15:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,starting to pick up on the more touchy
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.51,0:15:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,feely stuff huh that's some major growth\Nthis seems to happen with some frequency
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.89,0:15:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,perhaps you two are simply\Nill-matched i wouldn't go that far
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.32,0:16:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Stark. If you're uncomfortable,\Nyou can always just say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.64,0:16:06.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you wouldn't be in this party to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.55,0:16:10.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,begin with if i hadn't forced you\Nto join us if you hadn 't forced
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.64,0:16:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me. That's not why you're at a crossroads.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.97,0:16:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,crossroads it seems this path leads to the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.79,0:16:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,northern plateau while neutral harbor lies
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.85,0:16:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,down the other. Frieren, over there.\NDoes that look like an inn to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.68,0:16:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,end to you this is a frequently
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.42,0:16:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,traveled road at least we won't\Nhave to camp out tonight oh
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.89,0:16:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well look who it is
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.68,0:16:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seems our reunion came sooner\Nthan expected by the way stark
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.45,0:16:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thanks again for your help\Nwith That fresher business.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.58,0:16:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure thing, Wirbel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.22,0:16:56.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem to be well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.94,0:17:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ultimately, I decided\Nto travel home by sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.76,0:17:04.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,News from the north is dire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.61,0:17:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The demons are acting\Nup in the far reaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.82,0:17:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to get up there\Nas fast as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.62,0:17:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm with these two until we make\Nit to the capital, that is .
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.28,0:17:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's anxious about seasickness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.60,0:17:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whining's incessant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.98,0:17:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were a grown man, Wirbel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.10,0:17:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're far too old for whining.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.90,0:17:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.82,0:17:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here i thought i was still in the full\Nflower of my youth i 'm only a recent
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.58,0:17:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,departee from my 20s
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.67,0:17:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,funny all you old guys suffer\Nfrom the same delusions
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.01,0:17:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,anyway stark have you had\Ntime to think about my
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.17,0:17:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,proposition proposition
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.39,0:17:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the situation up
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.72,0:17:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,north has gone from bad\Nto worse quick reliable
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.60,0:17:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,frontline fighters are in serious demand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.47,0:17:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're free to say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.79,0:17:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we could really use your\Naxe, Stark, just for a few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.72,0:17:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,until things stabilize.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.73,0:18:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like I told you before, Wirbel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.26,0:18:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My services have been pledged already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.86,0:18:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's fair. But it's not in\Nmy nature to give up easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.01,0:18:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it comes to the safety of\Nthe North, I would do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.50,0:18:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Frieren, can I work on him a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.69,0:18:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.60,0:18:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may do as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.00,0:18:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mistress Frieren.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.57,0:18:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.58,0:18:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, Stark,\NI'm a fun guy to be around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.72,0:18:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems he's having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.97,0:18:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's a nice\Nchange of pace for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.69,0:18:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stark must find our party somewhat\Nrestrictive by comparison.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.70,0:18:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that doesn't sound\Nlike my kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.27,0:18:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, how'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.64,0:18:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I turned down Wirbel's offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.40,0:18:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.12,0:19:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you certain you don't have to stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.23,0:19:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I don't think either\Nof you realize why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.29,0:19:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I first met you and\NFreer, and I was at my limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.99,0:19:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't see the meaning in it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.36,0:19:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truth be told, I was ready to cut and run,\Nleave that village to fend for itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.83,0:19:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real heroic, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.80,0:19:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Frieren doesn't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.15,0:19:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's under the impression that she forced\Nme to join this party against my will,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.34,0:19:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but she's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.50,0:19:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just met, but I don't think you'll run.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.35,0:19:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your encouragement relit a fire in
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.69,0:19:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me that had been cold for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.13,0:19:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that moment, I knew the right\Nthing to do was to go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.63,0:19:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're just too\Nmodest to have noticed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.99,0:20:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Frieren isn't the only reason\Nmy cowardly hide is still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.91,0:20:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're also to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.55,0:20:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.35,0:20:18.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So please try and be nicer to me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.11,0:20:21.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.89,0:20:23.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come here, Stark.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.29,0:20:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for head pats.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.03,0:20:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What evil are you plotting?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.67,0:20:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.83,0:20:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a pain in the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.36,0:20:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.71,0:20:53.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,love
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.60,0:21:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.85,0:21:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I couldn't convince you after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.50,0:21:20.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You three should take the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.67,0:21:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would save you valuable time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.78,0:21:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ocean travel is a tad too expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.36,0:21:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.99,0:21:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, my master's party trekked through\Nthe northern plateau, and so will we.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.37,0:21:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're always accepting odd jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.43,0:21:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,landing ourselves in\Nall manner of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.26,0:21:42.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Detours are a part of our process.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.93,0:21:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've carved out quite the\Nadventurous path for yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.07,0:21:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't block it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.61,0:21:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.85,0:21:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll reach\Nthe far north eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.91,0:21:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But until then, you take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.92,0:22:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.45,0:22:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shall we be off?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.93,0:22:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.22,0:22:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.38,0:22:21.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you worry?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.05,0:22:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anata ni shirarenai yougi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.65,0:22:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anata o mamoremasu yougi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.53,0:22:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The story has only just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.15,0:22:41.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ate no nai michi naki
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.37,0:22:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,michi ni ite mo dokka.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.71,0:22:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mayoi nagara ite mo dokka.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.33,0:22:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kibou ga soko ni aru yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.77,0:22:57.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moni aru yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.79,0:23:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dokogi demo ikeru hane wo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.69,0:23:08.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anata ni sazuketa no donna yami mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.35,0:23:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harashite shimaeru yogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.61,0:23:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gave me holy brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.89,0:23:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Osoresu ni susume yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.19,0:23:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.83,0:23:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Furikaereba itsumo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.57,0:23:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.07,0:23:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anata ga warateta.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.16,0:23:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.77,0:23:45.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seems
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.90,0:23:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.81,0:23:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bit extreme.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.73,0:23:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe your joy merely\Ngrows with our story.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.57,0:23:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will die without achieving my goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.49,0:23:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the bright side, at\Nleast we defeated a demon.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:58.03,0:24:00.09,Signs_NextEp,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(229,1)\blur3\t(20,312,\blur0.2)\pos(320,113.5)\c&H000000&\t(312,646,\c&HF6F6F6&)\fsp1.6\t(\fsp1)}Episode 30\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\NThe Hero of the South
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.39,0:23:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the hero of the South.
